# ── Game data ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Not one byte of LBA1 lives here: the player brings their own copy, and the
# page keeps it in their browser. The extension rules catch a stray copy of
# the game's files anywhere in the tree, so it can't be committed by
# accident.
gamedata/
testdata/
dist/

*.hqr
*.HQR
*.vox
*.VOX
*.voc
*.VOC
*.lba
*.LBA
*.lst
*.LST
lba.cfg
LBA.CFG
*.dat
*.DAT
*.dot
*.DOT
*.fla
*.FLA
*.mp3
*.wav
# a mod's own voice clips (mod check keeps original game data out of a mod)
!mods/*/voices/*.wav
*.bmp
*.pcx
*.zip

# ── Build output ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
build/
*.o
*.d
*.map
*.exe
*.dll
*.log

# ── Local ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# A pristine copy of the upstream engine source, kept to diff against.
lba1-classic-community-main/
# Local tool settings, and secrets (API keys)
.claude/
.env
node_modules/
